  "title": "Crispy Squash Chips",
  "description": "Turn the peels of acorn squash into a savory snack by making them into cumin- and cinnamon-flavored chips, perfect alongside a lunch sandwich or bowl of soup.",
  "authors": [
    "DakotaKim"
  ],
